CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ T deduced after the class pack: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
`V...' in the parameter list of a member function template names the pack
of the enclosing class template specialization, which is bound; it was
treated as a function parameter pack of the member template, so the
parameters after it did not line up with their arguments.
